1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,410
This is what a normal day looked like.

2
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:05,500
I didn't know it yet.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,190
My alarm went off at seven, and I hit snooze twice.

4
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:12,880
I brushed my teeth in the same mirror, with the same face.

5
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:16,250
I walked to the bus stop past the same houses.

6
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,980
The same cat was on the same fence.

7
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:22,990
Afternoon cartoons, and a city name I had never heard of.

8
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:24,760
I changed the channel.

9
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,490
That night I left my window open.

10
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:31,500
Someone was standing under the streetlight, waiting for a friend.
